== Effects ==
* Increases the radius of all [[creep]] produced by Isaac, his familiars, and [[friendly]] enemies.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}} / {{t|Lost Cork|r+}}: Each copy further increases creep size. However, having 4+ copies will reset creep to its default size.

== Interactions ==
* {{dlc|r}} {{i|Sticky Bombs}}: No effect on the creep size from the bomb.
* {{i|Blood Bombs}}: No effect on the creep size from the bomb.

